    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n81636" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περι-λάμπω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>shine around</i> or <i>brightly</i>, <i><span class="en">
